          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Unique Action" typeId="ba93-e32d-f1ac-e188">▶ **SUPPORT**. Select one other friendly **INQUISITORIAL AGENT** operative visible to and within 6&quot; of this operative. Until the end of that operative’s next activation, add 1 to its APL stat.
◆ This operative cannot perform this action while within control range of an enemy operative.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
