          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Ability" typeId="3467-0678-083e-eb50">This operative cannot perform any actions other than **Apprehend**, **Charge**, **Dash**, **Fall Back**, **Fight**, **Guard**, **Reposition**, **Pick Up Marker** and **Place Marker**. It cannot use any weapons that aren’t on its datacard.</characteristic>
