            <characteristic name="Unique Action" typeId="ba93-e32d-f1ac-e188">▶ Select one enemy operative within this operative’s control range. Until that enemy operative is no longer within this operative’s control range, or until this operative performs this action again (whichever comes first), worsen the Hit stat of that enemy operative’s weapons by 1 (this isn’t cumulative with being injured); in addition, that enemy operative cannot perform the **Fall Back** action.
