      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Ability" typeId="3467-0678-083e-eb50">PSYCHIC ranged weapons cannot inflict damage on this operative. For the effects of PSYCHIC actions, this operative cannot be selected and is never treated as being within those actions’ required distances. Whenever an operative is within 6&quot; of this operative: 
